{
  "version": 1,
  "fps": 30,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "I lift every voice like a lantern in the dawn",
      "section": "section_1",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 2,
      "endFrame": 163
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "I hold every syllable like a seed of freedom rising",
      "section": "section_1",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 166,
      "endFrame": 312
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Lift every voice and sing as the heavens ring",
      "section": "section_1",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 315,
      "endFrame": 460
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Let the harmonies of liberty breathe through our bones",
      "section": "section_2",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 463,
      "endFrame": 608
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Let rejoicing rise high as listening skies",
      "section": "section_3",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 611,
      "endFrame": 762
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Let it roll like a sea of hope we built stone by stone",
      "section": "section_5",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 765,
      "endFrame": 937
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Sing a song full of the faith the dark past taught",
      "section": "section_5",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 940,
      "endFrame": 1098
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Sing a song full of the hope this new day brought",
      "section": "section_5",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1101,
      "endFrame": 1249
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Facing the rising sun of a morning just begun",
      "section": "section_5",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1252,
      "endFrame": 1409
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "We march on till victory is won",
      "section": "section_5",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1412,
      "endFrame": 1571
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Stony is the road we trod",
      "section": "section_5",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1574,
      "endFrame": 1750
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Bitter was the rod that tried to bend our light",
      "section": "section_5",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1753,
      "endFrame": 1907
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Yet with a steady beat our weary feet",
      "section": "section_5",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 1910,
      "endFrame": 2064
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Came to the place our elders dreamed in night",
      "section": "section_6",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 2067,
      "endFrame": 2225
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "We have come over a way watered with tears",
      "section": "section_6",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 2228,
      "endFrame": 2384
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "We have come through a path soaked by the slaughtered years",
      "section": "section_7",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 2387,
      "endFrame": 2562
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Out from the gloomy past",
      "section": "section_7",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 2565,
      "endFrame": 2717
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "To stand where a gleam breaks through at last",
      "section": "section_7",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 2720,
      "endFrame": 2876
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "God of our weary years",
      "section": "section_7",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 2879,
      "endFrame": 3031
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "God of our silent tears",
      "section": "section_7",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 3034,
      "endFrame": 3187
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "You carried us thus far on the way",
      "section": "section_7",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 3190,
      "endFrame": 3345
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "You led us by might into the light",
      "section": "section_7",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 3348,
      "endFrame": 3520
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Keep our steps in the path we pray",
      "section": "section_7",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 3523,
      "endFrame": 3676
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Lest our feet stray from the ground where we met you",
      "section": "section_7",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 3679,
      "endFrame": 3831
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Keep us true keep us true",
      "section": "section_7",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 3834,
      "endFrame": 3986
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Lest our hearts drunk with the wine of the world forget you",
      "section": "section_7",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 3989,
      "endFrame": 4138
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Keep us near keep us near",
      "section": "section_7",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 4141,
      "endFrame": 4310
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Shadowed beneath your hand we stand",
      "section": "section_7",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 4313,
      "endFrame": 4462
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "True to our God",
      "section": "section_7",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 4465,
      "endFrame": 4614
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "True to our native land",
      "section": "section_7",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 4617,
      "endFrame": 4767
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Rising like a dawn that refuses to dim",
      "section": "section_7",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 4770,
      "endFrame": 4918
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Till victory calls our name",
      "section": "section_8",
      "tag": null,
      "startFrame": 4921,
      "endFrame": 5087
    }
  ],
